  "text": "BluePearl Pet Hospital | East Dallas, Mesquite, TX\nSkip to the content\nJoin the BluePearl Family!\nWe're hiring.\nFind a Hospital\nSearch the site\nSearch\nSearch the site\nSearch\nResources for Pet Owners\nWhy BluePearl\nIntake Form\nPay with CareCredit\nPet Care Articles and Videos\nStories from the Heart\nResources for Veterinarians\nWhy Refer to BluePearl\nReferral Portal & Medical Records\nOrder BluePearl Materials\nMedical Library for DVMs\nAbout Us\nWho We Are\nOur Areas of Expertise\nNewsroom\nContact Us\nCareers\nFind a Hospital\nHome\nHospitals\nBluePearl Pet Hospital East Dallas Mesquite, TX\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nEast Dallas\nMesquite, TX\nEmergency\n972.226.3377\n4651 N Belt Line Rd\nMesquite, TX 75150\n[email protected]\nEmergency:\nLimited availability\nPlease call before arriving\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nBluePearl Pet Hospital – serving east Dallas.\nWe’re located just off I-30 in Mesquite, and we serve pets and their families throughout metro Dallas and the eastern suburbs.\nOur reviews.\nOur services.\nWhen your pet needs emergency care, seconds count. Our experienced team of veterinarians, vet technicians and support staff work closely together to provide the comprehensive, compassionate care your pet needs and deserves.\nEmergency\nIn an emergency, call ahead to your BluePearl vet and let us know you’re coming. No appointment is necessary for our emergency vet.\nLearn more about your emergency visit\n.\nSee Specialties and Services\nOur\nveterinarians.\nCaring for your pets is our passion. Meet our team of veterinarians here to help you and your pet.\nSee Veterinarians\nAbout BluePearl Pet Hospital East Dallas.\nOur technologically advanced facility uses the most sophisticated medical and surgical technology. Our staff is highly trained in emergency medicine and works tirelessly to care for your pet’s most difficult moments.\nWhile a referral from your family veterinarian is not required, we work closely with them to ensure your pet receives the best possible care. Please ask your veterinarian about BluePearl or call us for more information.\nPet owners.\nAt BluePearl, providing our customers with remarkable service is a top priority. We’re committed to making your veterinary visit as smooth as possible.\nHave questions prior to your visit? We’re happy to help. Contact our hospital team at\n972.226.3377\nor\n[email protected]\n.\nCurrent location.\n972.226.3377\n4651 N Belt Line Rd\nMesquite,\nTX                                    75150\n[email protected]\nOther hospitals.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nNorth Dallas\nLewisville, TX\n2700 Lake Vista Dr.\nLewisville, TX 75067\n972.820.7099\n24.37 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nOklahoma City, OK\n1401 W Memorial Rd.\nOklahoma City, OK 73114\n405.749.6989\n199.56 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nSpring, TX\n1646 Spring Cypress Rd.\nSpring, TX 77388\n832.616.5000\n202.03 miles\nGet In Touch\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\n2950 Busch Lake Blvd.\nTampa\n, FL\n33614\nContact Us\nFind a Hospital Near Me\nCareers at BluePearl\nBluePearl™ Cares\nWeb Accessibility\nYour Privacy Choices\nStay Connected\nHere for pets.\nWhen it matters most.\nStay connected with BluePearl for expert advice, helpful tips and trusted information to support you and your pet - delivered straight to your inbox.\nSign Up\ncookies notice\nprivacy policy\nlegal\nad choices\nterms & conditions\naccessibility\ncontact us\na\nbrand\n© 2026 BluePearl Holdings LLC. All rights reserved.\nCookie Settings",
